WEBVTT

00:01:57.420 --> 00:01:58.860
What the hell are they
doing here?!

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:00.350
Run!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:56.070
What is it doing in a
place like this?

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.190
I've confirmed the location of a
gate that leads to the target.

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:24.610
No irregularities being reported
from F-2 or surrounding areas.

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:26.480
Continue to execute your mission.

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:27.970
Roger.

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.910
The experiment is set to
begin at 1600 hours.

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.820
Orders received and
understood, Sir!

00:04:34.280 --> 00:04:35.770
What's that?

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:55.690
F-1 to Command Base, I have
breached the gate.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:58.660
Retinal pattern verification
complete. Target is...

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:01.070
F-1, what is it?

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:03.510
Target confirmed. Proceeding
to capture target.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:11.670
Master! Master, you need
to get out now!

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:29.820
This is...

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:07.600
No! That's a false god that will
bring the terror down upon us!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.920
What is it? F-1, come in.
What's going on?

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:26.720
Command Base to F-2, F-1 isn't
responding coherently.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:27.820
Expedite your analysis.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:31.260
Excavation completed.
Proceeding to stage two.

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.590
Oh, dear God...

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:00.020
This is F-2. I've completed
sample collection.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.290
Rush to F-1 's aid at once.

00:07:02.290 --> 00:07:03.560
She's not responding to our calls.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:05.360
We can't ascertain the situation.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:07.270
Proceed with caution.

00:07:07.270 --> 00:07:09.630
Roger! I'll head right over.

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:50.330
Kugai...

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:52.870
The kugai has returned!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:13.890
Big Brother?

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.790
What the hell is that thing?
It's like a...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.280
Big Brother!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:25.240
F-2, F-1 is being attacked. The
hostile appears to be a Fake type.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:28.210
Hurry! F-1 is not equipped with
any effective firepower.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.970
I'm lifting myself up to
the cavern now.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:55.230
F-2, correct gun sight calibration.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.220
Your crosshairs are out of
alignment due to jamming.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:58.830
Display B!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.890
Shift calibration,
minus twenty points.

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:11.400
Damn monster!

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.670
F-2, the mission is a failure.

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.340
Abandon your Fake, and
eject immediately.

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:17.380
Roger.

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.610
We'll set the self-destruct
on the Fakes.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:20.310
Disable your alarm. Set
self-destruct to twenty seconds.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:21.180
What about F-1?
Disable your alarm. Set
self-destruct to twenty seconds.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:22.650
We'll override the safeties
and forcibly eject her.

00:12:22.650 --> 00:12:24.550
The ejection seat isn't activating!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.080
The self-destruct countdown
is already running.

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.050
Evacuate the Fake on
your own power.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:27.590
Roger, will attempt manual
evacuation.
Evacuate the Fake on
your own power.

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.350
Roger, will attempt manual
evacuation.

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.620
Let's head out to retrieve
our pilots.

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.160
Damn it!

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:47.660
Respond, F-1!

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.430
What was that explosion?!

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:15.920
It's from our target point!

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:21.370
Command Base to S V201.

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:24.140
S V201 here. Over.

00:13:24.140 --> 00:13:25.980
We were unable to carry
out option two.

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:29.000
The Fakes took heavy damage. We
abandoned and destroyed them.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.420
We succeeded in retrieving
the pilot of F-2,

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.550
but the pilot of F-1 has been
captured by the enemy.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:35.280
We are on our way to the
rendezvous point.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:40.180
Aye, aye. Standing by at
point 218 by 35.

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.630
Take care of yourself on
the way back. Over.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.170
Check.

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:48.430
What?!
Check.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:49.330
What?!

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:51.300
Hold on a second! Let me
go back one turn!

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:54.000
Not a chance. You can't retract
moves on the battlefield.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.470
Should I neutralize with
the Gold Knight or...

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:59.680
Wow! This looks like another
victory for you, Captain Kaburagi.

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:01.280
You're amazing!

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:04.010
Just look at you two go at it.
Don't you ever get bored?

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:08.710
What else is there to do? We've
been stuck here all this time.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:14.350
I suppose we'll be stuck here until
they find Captain Ataka.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.650
I wonder where she went?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.830
Guess it's not a TA. Is it alive?

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:25.000
Yushiro!

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:32.040
Big Brother! Where?
Where are you?

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:36.600
Yushiro!

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:46.390
We will now begin the extended
operations trial

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:49.380
of the Type 17 Improved version
bipedal tactical armor system.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.790
Start the outer injection
to the pilots!

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.980
Sat One, final check procedure
complete. No data errors reported.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.010
At Gowa? Really?
Sat One, final check procedure
complete. No data errors reported.

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:07.340
System data bus connect. System
check reports no irregularities.

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:09.210
No, our experiment is just about
to begin as planned.
System data bus connect. System
check reports no irregularities.

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.680
No, our experiment is just about
to begin as planned.

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.280
Yes, then I'll talk to you later.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:16.590
What's the status of our pilots?

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:18.080
All crews standing by,
condition green.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:23.130
Did you inform them that the
injection agent was altered?

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:26.190
They don't know, just
as you instructed.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:27.860
That's good.

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:30.730
Let's start this now, shall we?

00:15:30.730 --> 00:15:31.940
Yes, Sir.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.060
Type 17 Improved
TA Experimental Platoon, rise!

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:42.780
Thirty-six hours... It's going
to take a while.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:56.150
Master Sorachi, what did I do?

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.760
What is that thing you
call the kugai?

00:15:59.530 --> 00:16:01.030
It is said that kugai
come into being

00:16:01.030 --> 00:16:02.870
through a miraculous
act of the Gasaraki,

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.890
and are operated by the kai.

00:16:07.100 --> 00:16:09.500
Kai? What are the kai?

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:11.940
Am I a kai?

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:16.380
To find answers to those
questions, you must go to Kyoto.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.850
Kyoto?

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:24.190
In the mountains south of Kyoto,
lies the ancient land of Watanabe.

00:16:24.190 --> 00:16:27.020
The kugai that was resting
in the old storehouse

00:16:27.020 --> 00:16:30.830
was found in that land and brought
back here by the Gowa clan.

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:32.230
I was there.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.360
You know the place?

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.170
I was there!

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:52.720
What are you talking about?
You were there before?

00:16:53.550 --> 00:16:55.040
I was there.

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.240
As were you!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:09.390
Yushiro will never know of the
truth if you remain in this land.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.940
Are you telling me to go there?

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:20.200
Yushiro!

00:17:21.880 --> 00:17:24.280
So this is the Gowa's secret.

00:17:27.180 --> 00:17:28.420
Here they come.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.980
Ms. Misuzu, I'll be leaving now!

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.560
I have a promise I need to keep.

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:36.760
I have to find my big brother!

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:38.390
All right, see you later!

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.970
While enemies, you are both of
the Monoyose kai bloodline,

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:46.700
and you have both awakened
to its powers.

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:51.870
The only path to the truth is for
both of you to travel together.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:05.490
What the hell happened here?

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:06.620
What is that thing?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.490
All units! Prepare for descent!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.120
Can you stand?

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.850
I'll leave you to search for him,
as you see fit.

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:48.490
It seems this was Yushiro's
debut in battle.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:52.830
I never expected such a calamity
to occur in my lifetime.

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:04.280
Hurry! We need to get as
far away as possible!

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:19.900
Sat Three has fallen.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:21.670
It appears that the pilot
is unconscious.

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:23.030
Reading abnormal activity
in his brain waves.

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:25.070
Send out the relief team!

00:19:25.070 --> 00:19:27.660
Relief team, rush to
Sat Three immediately.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.940
Oh, come on. Only one hundred
fifteen minutes thirty seconds?

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:37.310
We should abort this. We should
not have used that injection!

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:38.820
It's too much on a human being!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:43.090
If we gave up on everything
that failed 25% of the time,

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:46.290
we'd still be part of
the ape family.

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:50.820
Please remember the aim of this
experiment, Officer Kuwashima.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.330
Hurry up and retrieve Sat Three!

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:55.770
Remaining units are to continue
in three-man formation!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:57.260
Yes, Sir!

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.600
Sir...

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.040
I never expected you, Ms. Misuzu.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:05.530
My brother, please tell me
where my brother is?

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:10.870
Master Yushiro has
left on a journey.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.240
A journey?

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:17.620
Is my big brother...
My big brother...

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.110
Is he really my true brother?

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:24.830
Truth? What is that?

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.970
Such matters are, or are not, of
great importance to each person.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:33.240
This is something important to me,
beyond anything else!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:36.670
Ms. Misuzu, you must keep
inside yourself quietly

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.780
the matters that are of the most
importance to you.

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:45.050
Master Sorachi, I'm humbled by
your humility. Thank you.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.780
Please forgive my lapse
in courtesy.

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:51.460
I must warn you, if you should
meet Master Yushiro again,

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:56.830
he might not be the brother
you once knew.

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:59.350
My brother Yushiro is
my brother Yushiro!

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.560
That is the one eternal
truth for me!

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.240
This is the relief team.

00:21:12.240 --> 00:21:14.880
We've already disengaged
the L battery.

00:21:14.880 --> 00:21:18.180
We are about to manually open the
hatch and retrieve the pilot.

00:21:18.680 --> 00:21:20.180
Regarding the Type 17,

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:22.750
so far as we can judge at this
time, there is no notable...

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.240
Are you all right, Sir?

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:33.730
Hold it right there!

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.630
You are to be held for violating
the SSDF code of conduct!

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.120
You are to hold...

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:47.680
Lieutenant, get a grip on yourself!

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:49.170
Stop resisting now!

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:58.020
Emergency dispatch!

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:00.220
The pilot of Sat Three
has gone insane!

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:02.620
My repair and relief team
was attacked by him!

00:22:03.130 --> 00:22:07.460
There is also significant concern
for Sat One, Sat Two and Sat Four,

00:22:07.460 --> 00:22:10.700
and the physical condition
of their pilots!

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.030
Suggest we consider aborting
the current trial operation!

00:22:28.990 --> 00:22:33.810
Hark

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:40.260
It's time I journey

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:50.930
Break apart my heart

00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:57.460
For crimson sadness

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:04.970
Pours out from it

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:08.890
I can only, oh

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:12.080
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:12.170 --> 00:23:17.690
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:36.790
I can only, oh

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:39.940
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:45.140
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:53.120
I beg you, be by my side

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:03.980
In total silence, we run down
the path of the kai.

00:24:03.980 --> 00:24:06.080
Like phosphorescent
puffs of smoke,

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:09.250
words emerge at the back of my
head, then fade away.

00:24:10.090 --> 00:24:12.610
Words I once heard long ago.

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.750
The vows exchanged before.

00:24:15.760 --> 00:24:18.350
Along this road, I'm certain I will
encounter my past somewhere.

00:24:19.660 --> 00:24:21.470
I follow this path

00:24:21.470 --> 00:24:24.400
But yet again, the path of
the kai fades away

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:27.860
Where might I find the ties to
bind me to the truth I seek
